  "story": {
    "title": "Monkeys Share",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "\"I'd like one more banana\", said first monkey .",
      "The second monkey said, \"I will take one more banana.\"",
      "The third said, \"No. I'll take one more banana.\"",
      "Fourth monkey said, \"No! I am the eldest. So I'll take one more banana.\"",
      "The fifth was the beloved of all. He said, \"Mother! Give me one more banana.\"",
      "Mother said, \"No! I will not give more bananas to anyone. Everyone will get bananas, equally.\"",
      "\"Everyone stand in a line!\"",
      "On hearing this, everyone stood up to make a line. Mother gave equal number of bananas to each one.",
      "\"Mother, we have got 3 bananas each, for the 6 of us. That means a total of 18 bananas have been divided. Now two more bananas are left. How will you distribute them?\", asked the smallest monkey.",
      "\"Now, I'll cut each banana into 3 pieces.\" Saying this, mother cut both bananas into 3 pieces and distributed them to everyone.",
      "\"Oh mother! Everyone got three and a quarter of bananas. Chhotu shouted and hung on a branch after eating the bananas."
    ],
